[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576461700","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101246#issuecomment-2576461700","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101246","id":2576461700,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zka-E","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T00:14:23Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T00:15:53Z","body":"I'm wondering, since it's easy to create side effects in this code, if conditions like that should be use instead.\r\n```\r\nif (p_event->is_pressed() && (mouse_button.is_null() || status.hovering)) {\r\n\tstatus.press_attempt = true;\r\n\tstatus.pressing_inside = true;\r\n\tif (!status.pressed_down_with_focus) {\r\n\t\tstatus.pressed_down_with_focus = true;\r\n\t\temit_signal(SNAME(\"button_down\"));\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n```\r\n```\r\nif (!p_event->is_pressed()) {\r\n\tstatus.press_attempt = false;\r\n\tstatus.pressing_inside = false;\r\n\tif (status.pressed_down_with_focus) {\r\n\t\tstatus.pressed_down_with_focus = false;\r\n\t\temit_signal(SNAME(\"button_up\"));\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n```\r\nWorst case scenario, the `button_down` or `button_up` are not emitted but they are a lot less used.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576461700/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576784140","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101246#issuecomment-2576784140","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101246","id":2576784140,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZlpsM","user":{"login":"badsectoracula","id":20316467,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMzE2NDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20316467?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula","html_url":"https://github.com/badsectoracula","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/badsectoracula/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T05:28:31Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T05:28:31Z","body":"I tried and works, however i'll agree with Hilderin that `button_up` should be emitted after any press event. I modified the code a bit to use an `emit_button_up` boolean which is checked at the end of the function above `queue_draw` (using the existing code) and it seemed to work fine, so i'd recommend that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576784140/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2577922378","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101246#issuecomment-2577922378","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101246","id":2577922378,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zp_lK","user":{"login":"wlsnmrk","id":23439518,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDM5NTE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23439518?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlsnmrk","html_url":"https://github.com/wlsnmrk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlsnmrk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlsnmrk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlsnmrk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlsnmrk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlsnmrk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlsnmrk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlsnmrk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlsnmrk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlsnmrk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T15:14:41Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T15:22:22Z","body":"> I'm wondering, since it's easy to create side effects in this code, if conditions like that should be use instead.\r\n\r\nGreat suggestion, thanks. I've done exactly this. I've removed the special-case button-up signal for toggle buttons with `ACTION_MODE_BUTTON_PRESSED`, so with respect to the above discussion about signal order, this is currently preserving the somewhat inconsistent 4.3 behavior. If a fix/change is desired there, I can take a look at it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2577922378/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2577971150","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101246#issuecomment-2577971150","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101246","id":2577971150,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZqLfO","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T15:33:36Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T15:33:36Z","body":"> I've removed the special-case button-up signal for toggle buttons with ACTION_MODE_BUTTON_PRESSED\r\n\r\nGreat!\r\n\r\n> so with respect to the above discussion about signal order, this is currently preserving the somewhat inconsistent 4.3 behavior. If a fix/change is desired there, I can take a look at it.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure it causes any issue right now. I suggest we wait for an actual bug report on this.\r\n\r\nI'll test a bit more your last commit but it looks good.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2577971150/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578230854","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101246#issuecomment-2578230854","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101246","id":2578230854,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZrK5G","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T17:29:16Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T17:29:16Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578230854/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"lau